#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: pnscripts-price-history.php
msgid "PN Scripts Price History for Discounts"
msgstr "PN Scripts Price History dla promocji"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: pnscripts-price-history.php
msgid "https://pnscripts.com/marketplace/pnscripts-price-history"
msgstr "https://pnscripts.com/marketplace/pnscripts-price-history"

#. Description of the plugin
#: pnscripts-price-history.php
msgid ""
"Records every product and variation price change and shows the lowest price "
"in the 30 days before a discount (EU Price Indication Directive, Art. 6a). "
"Shows nothing when the history is incomplete."
msgstr ""
"Zapisuje każdą zmianę ceny produktów i wariantów oraz pokazuje najniższą "
"cenę z 30 dni przed obniżką (dyrektywa w sprawie podawania cen, art. 6a). "
"Nie pokazuje niczego, gdy historia jest niepełna."

#. Author of the plugin
#: pnscripts-price-history.php
msgid "PN Scripts"
msgstr "PN Scripts"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: pnscripts-price-history.php
msgid "https://pnscripts.com"
msgstr "https://pnscripts.com"

#: src/Admin/CategoryFields.php:43 src/Admin/CategoryFields.php:55
